      "vulnSlug": "acl-check",
      "title": "Any anonymous guest can exhaust the global build allowance",
      "description": "The compatibility policy repeats the production-shaped `builds` rule that permits every identity with a non-null `@user.id` to append a caller-selected amount, while anonymous accounts are enabled. A guest can append `BUILD_ALLOWANCE` in one record, exhausting the global rolling window for 24 hours, blocking legitimate records, and poisoning accounting. The append-only rules prevent early removal.",
